(I think the answer is pretty simple. But of course, easier said than done. I personally think that) Tj
T* (the easiest, fastest and surest way to convince parents of otherwise is to show them kids, of) Tj
T* (varying ages and backgrounds, excelling in tech, because one thing is sure: no parent wants) Tj
T* (their kid to be left behind... and as such, FOMO \(Fear Of Missing Out\) has to be installed in) Tj
T* (them.) Tj
